<view class="page">
  <view class="balance-card">
    <view class="label">可用余额（元）</view>
    <view class="balance">{{loading ? '读取中' : availableBalance}}</view>
    <view class="pending">待审核返现：¥{{pendingReward}}</view>
    <view class="pending">提现处理中：¥{{withdrawalProcessing}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">{{errorMessage}}</view>
    <t-button theme="primary" block bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</t-button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">说明</view>
    <view>待审核返现仅为预计金额，审核通过后才会进入可用余额。</view>
    <view>提现申请和提现记录服务仍在接入中。</view>
  </view>
</view>
